<view class="page-shell sales-sub-page" data-route="/pages/sales/promotion" data-visual-state="{{loading ? 'loading' : errorMessage ? 'error' : promo ? 'ready' : 'empty'}}"><view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">销售中心 / 推广</text><text class="page-title">推广素材</text><text class="page-subtitle">复制链接或直接分享，首次进入的客户会记录归属。</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="surface empty-state"><text>正在加载推广素材</text></view><view wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" class="surface empty-state"><text>{{errorMessage}}</text><view class="secondary-button empty-button" bindtap="openLogin">去登录</view></view><view wx:else class="surface promo-detail"><text class="block-title">我的推广链接</text><text class="promo-link">{{promo.sharePath || '暂未生成'}}</text><view class="promo-actions"><view class="primary-button" bindtap="copy">复制链接</view><button class="secondary-button" open-type="share">立即分享</button></view><text class="muted">二维码和海报素材由服务端按推广人生成，当前环境没有真实图片时会保留分享入口。</text></view></view>
